{"id":"memorial_101003","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101000","label":"Memoirs · Pamphlet"},"label":"3. Self-Defense Training","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101002","next":"memorial_101004","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101003_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"Get in shape to survive!"},{"id":"memorial_101003_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"In these times, it's a must."},{"id":"memorial_101003_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"Why, you ask?"},{"id":"memorial_101003_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"Because you can run away from Raptures quickly."},{"id":"memorial_101003_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"Because you can keep your belongings safe from burglars."},{"id":"memorial_101003_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_10_03_description","text":"Because your fists still can even if the law can no longer protect you."}]}